    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 16 · 5:12 · the end</span>
      <strong>The run stops on the completion animation</strong>
      The video ends at 5:12 on a gold emblem with a green progress bar filling behind it — the level's completion flourish. There is no results card with a coin figure before the footage stops, so this page does not print a reward number for Study Room.
      <div class="ts">Watch: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2S33pol9jGE&t=312s" target="_blank" rel="noopener">5:12</a></div>
