      <b>1. What the safe contains.</b> The dial is worked between 2:51 and 3:05 and the combination is confirmed from the game's own hint, but the recording does not settle on a clear shot of the safe standing open with its contents. We therefore do not claim what is inside it.
      <br><br>
      <b>2. The stamped number on the book spine.</b> It OCRs as <b>1745</b> in some frames and as 11745 or J7A5 in others, and a 3x crop was still unstable. It is not used by any lock in the run, so we have left it out of the guide rather than pick a reading.
      <br><br>
